50 per cent brighter = 0.44 magnitude = the Sun 0.34 degree lower at the passing; at 21, 31 and 41 degrees south, late June and early August, that takes 1.5 to 2.0 minutes
60 per cent brighter = 0.51 magnitude = the Sun 0.39 degree lower at the passing; at 21, 31 and 41 degrees south, late June and early August, that takes 1.7 to 2.3 minutes
from sunset to the Sun 6.5 degrees down, at 21, 31 and 41 degrees south, through the year: 24 to 37 minutes
